.TH HALCYON 1 "2026-11-11" "Halcyon 0.6.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
halcyon \- desktop widgets and themes for COSMIC
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B halcyon
.br
.B halcyon --settings
.RI [ page ]
.br
.B halcyon --toggle
.I target
.br
.B halcyon
.RB [ --help | --version ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Halcyon displays desktop widgets and coordinates wallpaper, colors,
windows, dock and panel appearance on the COSMIC desktop.
Run without arguments to display widgets.
Only one copy shows widgets at a time: a second
.B halcyon
says Halcyon is already running and exits.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --settings " \fR[\fIpage\fR]"
Open Settings and the first-run setup, on
.I page
if given (for example
.BR clock ,
.B weather
or
.BR notes ).
.TP
.BI --toggle " target"
Ask the running widgets to open or close the edge menu
.RB ( drawer ),
or to show or hide one widget
.RB ( calendar ,
.BR projects ,
.BR devbox ,
.BR weather ,
.BR clock ,
.BR glance ,
.BR music ,
.B notes
or
.BR focus ).
Bind it to a key in COSMIC Settings, Keyboard shortcuts.
In the edge menu, Tab and the arrow keys move, Enter shows or hides a widget,
Alt+Up and Alt+Down reorder the right column, and Esc closes the menu.
.TP
.B --help
Show a summary of these options and exit.
.TP
.B --version
Show the version and exit.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success, including when Halcyon is already running;
1 when a command could not reach the running widgets;
2 for an unknown option or target.
.SH FILES
.I $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/halcyon/widgets.lock
is held while the widgets run.
.br
.I /usr/share/backgrounds/halcyon/
contains the installed wallpapers.
.br
.I /usr/share/doc/cosmic-ext-halcyon/
contains license and artwork documentation.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR halcyon-ctl (1)
.br
https://github.com/profilaz3/halcyon
